## Papers, PDFs and identifiers

This repository contains no downloaded papers. `fetch_pdf.py` fetches open-access
full text at runtime into a directory that `.gitignore` excludes. Bibliographic
records come from the Crossref, OpenAlex, Unpaywall and Semantic Scholar APIs at
runtime; only small placeholder fixtures are stored in `examples/`.

Sci-Hub, LibGen and Z-Lib are deliberately not supported. See the "Downloading full
text" section of the README.
